# Quitting while the window is covered still saves (LIF-5, Mac): a covered window slows the game loop to DM_HIDDEN_HZ, and the quit puts it back to
# full speed before asking the game for its save, so the save commits within the quit's wait. Windowed on the CLI host: the cover window has to sit
# on the game's Space.
name quit_while_covered_saves
requires cli
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
stick 0 1 frames=30
app cover
expect app state=occluded timeout=5
sleep 3
system_quit
check saved
check exit 0
check event quit_save saved=true
check no_red
